'''Kaoluga''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Tales of the Nekoluga (Gacha Event)|Tales of the Nekoluga]] gacha event. It was added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 15.1 Update|Version 15.1]] increases health, [[Knockback]] chance and [[Surge Attack|Mini-Surge]] level, and gains [[Colossus Slayer]] and [[Immune to Surge|Surge Immunity]].

